{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/pl6wpx","slideIndex":1,"text":"Last time, we showed that the camera could identify the field and that the robot could move. This time, the question is whether the robot can use a new image to see what actually moved before making its next decision.\n\n中文提示：上次展示了看得见场地和车能动。这次问一个更具体的问题：动作之后，怎样用新画面判断块到底有没有推到位？\n\nSource: 输出/机器人推块比赛_第三次汇报_成果与计划_可编辑版.pptx; 程序与测试清单.md"}
