{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/9m9e8d","slideIndex":2,"text":"We correct the camera view using the four field corners. The tag on the robot gives its position and heading. After the ESP32 executes a short movement, the PC measures again from a fresh image. If the view is no longer reliable, the program stops instead of continuing from the old image.\n\n中文提示：用场地四角把画面校正，用车顶定位码读车的位置和朝向。电脑下发一次短动作，之后再看新画面。旧画面或丢定位时不继续推。\n\nSource: vision/latest_camera.py; control/vision_approach_test.py; control/多块入区测试说明.md"}
