{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7aw82c","slideIndex":4,"text":"The test runs the real vision processing and control program against simulated camera frames and a simulated ESP32. It reached each of the three distances. It also checked that a stall, a lost tag, or a rejected command does not count as a completed push.\n\n中文提示：电脑端联调跑了六种情况：20、100、150 毫米三种位移，以及卡住、丢码、指令被拒三种失败。这里运行了真实识别和控制程序，但相机画面和车端是模拟的。\n\nSource: tmp/multi-full-check.log, lines 199–204; control/test_push_integration.py"}
