{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/0sgzf7","slideIndex":5,"text":"For multiple blocks, reaching a distance is not enough. The robot selects an accessible block and pushes it fully into the yellow zone. It then backs away and checks that the whole block remains in the zone before counting it and selecting another.\n\n中文提示：多块不是简单重复推 100 毫米。需要先选有路线的目标，推入黄区，退开后再确认整个块还在黄区；确认后才计数、选下一块。\n\nSource: control/多块入区测试说明.md; control/multi_push_control.py"}
