{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/mzngxw","slideIndex":7,"text":"The field logs showed two separate issues. Large false boxes blocked the start, and status requests sometimes timed out. The program now keeps a start request pending while it waits for stable input. If a problem occurs while moving, it still stops and requires a new start.\n\n中文提示：现场问题分成两类：过大框导致启动检查不过，热点状态查询也曾偶发超时。现在空格可以先提交启动请求，条件未稳就等待；车已动时发生异常仍停车，需要重新启动。\n\nSource: control/多块入区测试说明.md; tmp/one-space-multi-check.log; tmp/reconnect-multi-check.log"}
