{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/e1mj14","slideIndex":8,"text":"We will fix the camera, verify that the tag and the blocks stay visible, and start with two separated blocks. We will record the block displacement and check that the robot stops. For multi-block testing, we will only count a delivery after the robot backs away and the block remains in the yellow zone.\n\n中文提示：先固定相机并校准，放两块分开的同色块，确定识别不串框。先做一次单块 100 毫米实测，再测两块连续入区；每块都要在退车后确认留在黄区。全程保留视频和日志。\n\nSource: control/单块自主推送测试说明.md; control/多块入区测试说明.md"}